{"seq":68,"slug":"graph-databases","title":"图数据库","stage":"DONE","category":"cs-fundamentals","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/graph-databases","rating":{"composite":3.67,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4,"strategic":3.67},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introMarkdown":"# 图数据库\n\n关系型数据库把世界拆成一张张二维表，再用外键把它们勉强缝合起来。当你真正关心的不是「一行数据是什么」而是「它和谁相连、隔几步能到达谁」时，这种缝合就开始漏水：每多问一层关系，就多一次 JOIN，查询随深度指数级变慢。图数据库把关系提升为头等公民——节点与边都是可直接寻址、可携带属性的实体，沿边游走是常数级开销而非一次表扫描。这一个看似朴素的改变，重塑了从社交网络、欺诈识别到知识图谱与 GraphRAG 的整片落地版图。\n\n这个 hub 用四章把图数据库从地基讲到屋顶，层层递进。\n\n第一章「基础」立桩：先讲清两种主流的图数据模型（属性图与 RDF 三元组）到底长什么样，再回答「为什么不用关系库就好」这个绕不开的问题，最后把图模型与关系模型正面摆在一起对比，让你知道边界在哪、何时该选谁。\n\n第二章「建模与查询」教你把现实问题翻译成图：如何为一个领域设计节点、边与属性的结构；如何用 Cypher、Gremlin 与 2024 年成为 ISO 标准的 GQL 写出查询；以及遍历这一图数据库的核心动作有哪些经典模式。这一章是「人怎么和图对话」。\n\n第三章「内部机制」掀开引擎盖：免索引邻接为什么能让多跳查询不随数据量变慢，存储引擎如何在磁盘与内存里安放节点和边，查询执行器如何规划与优化一条遍历，以及在「指针游走」的世界里索引还扮演什么角色。这一章解释「为什么图查询能快」。\n\n第四章「应用与生态」收口落地：最短路、中心性与社区发现这三类图算法如何把结构变成洞察；Neo4j、TigerGraph 与 Amazon Neptune 这些主流产品各自押注了什么；以及当下最热的知识图谱与 GraphRAG 如何用图为大模型提供可溯源、抗幻觉的事实地基。\n\n四章一脉相承：先懂数据长什么样，再学怎么查它，然后理解它为何快，最后看它在真实世界里解决什么。读完你不仅会用图数据库，更知道它在什么场景下值得用、在什么场景下是杀鸡用牛刀。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础","docCount":3,"url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/graph-databases/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"graph-data-model","title":"图数据模型：属性图与 RDF","url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/graph-databases/foundations/graph-data-model"},{"seq":2,"slug":"why-graph-databases","title":"为何使用图数据库","url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/graph-databases/foundations/why-graph-databases"},{"seq":3,"slug":"graph-vs-relational","title":"图与关系模型对比","url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/graph-databases/foundations/graph-vs-relational"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"modeling","title":"建模与查询","docCount":3,"url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/graph-databases/modeling","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"graph-modeling","title":"图建模","url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/graph-databases/modeling/graph-modeling"},{"seq":2,"slug":"cypher-gremlin-gql","title":"查询语言：Cypher、Gremlin 与 GQL","url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/graph-databases/modeling/cypher-gremlin-gql"},{"seq":3,"slug":"traversal-patterns","title":"遍历模式","url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/graph-databases/modeling/traversal-patterns"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"internals","title":"内部机制","docCount":3,"url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/graph-databases/internals","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"graph-storage-engines","title":"图存储引擎与免索引邻接","url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/graph-databases/internals/graph-storage-engines"},{"seq":2,"slug":"query-execution","title":"图查询执行与优化","url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/graph-databases/internals/query-execution"},{"seq":3,"slug":"indexing-graphs","title":"图索引","url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/graph-databases/internals/indexing-graphs"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"applications","title":"应用与生态","docCount":3,"url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/graph-databases/applications","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"graph-algorithms","title":"图算法：最短路、中心性与社区发现","url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/graph-databases/applications/graph-algorithms"},{"seq":2,"slug":"graph-products","title":"产品生态：Neo4j、TigerGraph 与 Neptune","url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/graph-databases/applications/graph-products"},{"seq":3,"slug":"knowledge-graphs-graphrag","title":"知识图谱与 GraphRAG","url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/graph-databases/applications/knowledge-graphs-graphrag"}]}]}